  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5e985c66836c5dc324e347d091f040b, type: 3}
  m_Name: Terminlogy
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  terms:
  - termID: ORION
    title: ORION
    description: A special force with 9 members with their own expertise during the
      Eclipse war, only Rigel survived from the war.
  - termID: MOD
    title: MOD
    description: A powerful tech developed by ministry of science which can enhance
      the weapon and even change its mechanism.
  - termID: FIREPOWER
    title: Firepower
    description: Decide how much damage a single bullet can deal
  - termID: RATE OF FIRE
    title: Rate Of Fire
    description: Decide how frequent the weapon can fire.
  - termID: Eclipse War
    title: Eclipse War
    description: 'on M.C. 547, an eclipse happened in eastern part of the Republic
      of mammals, this is also the time when Arthropods Union lanuched their first
      attack,symbolizing the start of the war.

      The war lasted for 5 years,
      with great loss on both sides, R.O.F made a truce with A.U.  with slight advantage.
      Although the war has ended 7 years ago,it is not ended theoratically.'
  - termID: MEISSA
    title: Meissa
    description: Captain of the ORION. Being genetically modified and implanted with
      cyberware since a very young age, Meissa was once the best warrior in the Republic
      of Mammels. During the Eclipse war, Meissa and his team was ambushed and exterminated
      but no one discovered Meissa's body since than.
